# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/COB_0001300> (device)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/COB_0001300> "A processed material entity which is designed to be capable of a process."@en)
